495 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle was developed on behalf of the Department of Defense \(DOD\) Chief Digital and AI Office \(CDAO\) to address the specific needs of the CDAO and its customer organizations within the AI/ML, digital, and data solution space, and is focused on the Strategic Focus Areas identified within this official TSM Announcement. Any participating SBIR/STTR Firm, assignee, or successor in interest to a relevant, Phase III-eligible SBIR/STTR solution, may submit a solution video to the TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle. The TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle is available for viewing by all Government users \(.mil and .gov\) via TradewindAI.com. )
/E (The TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle was developed on behalf of the Department of Defense \(DOD\) Chief Digital and AI Office \(CDAO\) to address the specific needs of the CDAO and its customer organizations within the AI/ML, digital, and data solution space, and is focused on the Strategic Focus Areas identified within this official TSM Announcement. Any participating SBIR/STTR Firm, assignee, or successor in interest to a relevant, Phase III-eligible SBIR/STTR solution, may submit a solution video to the TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle. The TSM SBIR/STTR Aisle is available for viewing by all Government users \(.mil and .gov\) via TradewindAI.com. )
